---
description: Rules for shared contracts (Zod schemas, JSON Schema, OpenAPI/AsyncAPI generation)
globs: packages/contracts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Zod 4 is the single source (ADR 009). JSON Schema is generated for the Rust agent (typify); OpenAPI 3.1 and AsyncAPI
  are generated and committed. CI fails on drift.
- Breaking change → bump the contract version and keep the old shape until agents below minimum get 426.
- This package imports nothing from apps or other internal packages.
